  "notes": "{暖|あたた}める is an ichidan (transitive) verb meaning to warm or heat something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{暖|あたた}まる→暖まる：01856_atatamaru⟧ (intransitive — to warm up by itself)\n\nKANJI VARIATION:\nBoth {暖|あたた}める and ⟦{温|あたた}める→温める：02096_atatameru⟧ are used, with a subtle difference:\n- {暖|あたた}める: warming air, rooms, atmosphere\n- ⟦{温|あたた}める→温める：02096_atatameru⟧: warming food, body, water\nIn practice, they are often used interchangeably.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{部屋|へや}→部屋：00507_heya⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{暖|あたた}める: to warm up a room\n- ⟦スープ→スープ：00395_suupu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{温|あたた}める→温める：02096_atatameru⟧: to heat up soup\n- ⟦{体|からだ}→体：00784_karada⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{温|あたた}める→温める：02096_atatameru⟧: to warm one's body\n- ⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{温|あたた}める→温める：02096_atatameru⟧: to warm one's heart (figurative)",
